    "detailed_description": "Jump Fall: A Captivating 3D Platformer Full of Challenges<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOverview:<br />\r\nWelcome to Jump Fall, an exciting 3D platformer where you'll navigate through a variety of obstacles and puzzles. Use your Jump 'n' Run skills to progress and maximize your mechanic across thrilling levels (currently only one).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Versatile Gameplay: Combine Jump 'n' Run maneuvers with your given mechanic to open up a new dimension of possibilities as you advance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Innovative Tools: In the first level, you get a grappling hook that can save you from falling or pull you towards hard-to-reach obstacles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Progress Tracking: Move forward from checkpoint to checkpoint and manually save your progress to pick up where you left off.",
    "about_the_game": "Jump Fall: A Captivating 3D Platformer Full of Challenges<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOverview:<br />\r\nWelcome to Jump Fall, an exciting 3D platformer where you'll navigate through a variety of obstacles and puzzles. Use your Jump 'n' Run skills to progress and maximize your mechanic across thrilling levels (currently only one).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Versatile Gameplay: Combine Jump 'n' Run maneuvers with your given mechanic to open up a new dimension of possibilities as you advance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Innovative Tools: In the first level, you get a grappling hook that can save you from falling or pull you towards hard-to-reach obstacles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Progress Tracking: Move forward from checkpoint to checkpoint and manually save your progress to pick up where you left off.",
    "short_description": "Dive into Jump Fall, a thrilling 3D platformer where you master obstacles and puzzles using Jump 'n' Run skills and unique mechanics. The first level features a grappling hook to navigate tough terrains and avoid falls. Progress through checkpoints and save manually to resume your adventure anytime.",
